    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
      <!-- Constructivism -->
      <div class="bg-blue-50 dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold font-heading mb-2">Constructivism</h3>
        <p class="text-muted dark:text-slate-300 mb-6">
          Learners build knowledge actively through doing, not passive reception — directly aligned with the hands-on
          coding nature of this course.
        </p>

        <h4 class="font-semibold text-green-700 dark:text-green-400 mb-2">Strengths</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 mb-6 text-muted dark:text-slate-300">
          <li class="flex gap-2">
            <span class="text-green-600 mt-1">✓</span>
            <span
              ><strong>Active learning:</strong> Learners write, test, and debug real code — leading to deeper retention
              and application.</span
            >
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-2">
            <span class="text-green-600 mt-1">✓</span>
            <span
              ><strong>Problem-solving:</strong> Practical projects develop critical thinking essential for JavaScript and
              xAPI implementation.</span
            >
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h4 class="font-semibold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 mb-2">Limitations</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 mb-6 text-muted dark:text-slate-300">
          <li class="flex gap-2">
            <span class="text-amber-600 mt-1">△</span>
            <span
              ><strong>Frustration risk:</strong> Coding can overwhelm beginners without adequate scaffolding and support.</span
            >
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-2">
            <span class="text-amber-600 mt-1">△</span>
            <span
              ><strong>Time commitment:</strong> Constructivist learning requires significant practice time, which varies
              by learner.</span
            >
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h4 class="font-semibold mb-2">Applied in This Course</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-1 text-muted dark:text-slate-300 text-sm">
          <li>→ Project-based weekly coding challenges building toward a final xAPI-enabled eLearning element</li>
          <li>→ Scaffolded exercises with templates and code snippets, reducing support as confidence grows</li>
          <li>→ Debugging challenges where learners fix broken code</li>
          <li>→ Peer code reviews and reflection journals</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Connectivism -->
