          <li class="flex gap-2">
            <span class="text-amber-600 mt-1">△</span>
            <span
              ><strong>Structure dependency:</strong> Learners without self-direction may struggle in loosely structured
              network environments.</span
            >
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h4 class="font-semibold mb-2">Applied in This Course</h4>
